                <pb facs="1068" n="972" sameAs="frus:frus1926v02/pg972"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">704.5483/23: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Egypt</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Howell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-08-20T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 20,
                                1926—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>18. (1) Report briefly by telegraph action taken on Department’s written
                    instruction 276 of July 7.</p>
                <p>(2) Have you arranged with British Residency for formal transfer of Swiss
                    interests?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
